VERDANDI-ART 0
# STUDIO-2, the second world: "sunlit harbour terraces at midday", dressed on the same tactical graybox as the plaza at
# night, so that the studio holds two worlds from its first start. Nothing here moves a wall, a floor, a cover block or
# a spawn. The direction, in one breath: pale limestone and whitewash under a high sun, a dry haze off the water;
# painted team colours instead of neon — ochre at base A in the west, sea-blue at base B in the east, coral where they
# meet; awnings in place of the concrete slabs.

map tactical
title Sunlit harbour terraces at midday
seed saltwind

time day
sun 150 62 90000 255,246,228
fog 0.012 214,226,236
exposure -0.6
bloom 0.3
rain 0.0

# every mesh names where it came from and under what licence
asset cube /Engine/BasicShapes/Cube.Cube engine Unreal Engine EULA (engine content)

# the palette: limestone, whitewash, dry stone paving, tide pools, painted steel, and three team colours as painted
# signs, lit faintly from within (a sign is a neon here, and a neon must emit)
material concrete       214,206,188 0.82 0.0
material concrete_dark  176,168,152 0.88 0.0
material concrete_wet   198,192,178 0.70 0.0
material floor_wet      188,176,152 0.78 0.0
material plaza_stone    226,218,200 0.64 0.0
material puddle          52,96,118  0.05 0.0
material housing         70,92,104  0.40 0.7
material neon_amber     214,150,52  0.55 0.0 emissive 214,150,52 4
material neon_cyan       40,120,170 0.55 0.0 emissive 40,120,170 4
material neon_magenta   232,110,92  0.55 0.0 emissive 232,110,92 4

# the play geometry: what C holds, in the look's materials
surface ground floor_wet
surface floor  floor_wet
surface stair  floor_wet
surface raised plaza_stone
surface cover  concrete_wet
surface wall   concrete

# regions: names for the places the look talks about (cells, x across and z down). The mid lane is two regions, west
# and east of the plaza: one region crossing the plaza put two puddles in one place, which the exporter refuses.
region base-a      2,9  8,22
region base-b     39,9 45,22
region north-lane  5,3 42,6
region south-lane  5,25 42,28
region mid-west    9,14 18,17
region mid-east   29,14 38,17
region plaza      19,10 28,21
region north-flank 23,7 24,9
region south-flank 23,22 24,24

# massing: the city beyond the walls, and the towers that make the plaza a room
skyline concrete_dark 8 26
tower plaza concrete_monument 16 30
tower base-a concrete 6 10
tower base-b concrete 6 10
# a cantilevered slab over the plaza's north edge, and its twin over the south edge
canopy plaza concrete_slab 7.0 19,10 28,11
canopy plaza concrete_slab 7.0 19,20 28,21

# light: the sun does the work; lamps low and warm in the shaded lanes and flanks
neon base-a neon_amber 2.9 3
neon base-b neon_cyan 2.9 3
neon plaza neon_magenta 3.1 2
neon mid-west neon_magenta 2.6 5
neon mid-east neon_magenta 2.6 5
lamp north-lane 255,214,170 120 4
lamp south-lane 255,214,170 120 4
lamp north-flank 255,226,190 150 1
lamp south-flank 255,226,190 120 2
lamp plaza 255,236,210 100 3

# water: tide pools left on the paving
puddle plaza puddle 35
puddle mid-west puddle 25
puddle mid-east puddle 25
puddle north-lane puddle 20
puddle south-lane puddle 20

# viewpoints for critique: fixed first-person poses, each where a player can stand (yaw 0 north, 90 east)
view base-a-exit    8,15  90  0
view north-flank   23,8  180  4
view plaza-centre  24,15  90  2
view plaza-corner  20,21  40  6
view south-lane    12,26  90  0
view mid-west      13,16  90  0
material concrete_monument 232,224,206 0.80 0.0
material concrete_slab 236,214,170 0.85 0.0
canopy plaza concrete_slab 7.6 19,12 20,19
